From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: rnsbox <rnsbox@localhost>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 23:04:06 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 03/13] portal: rnsbox-portal C++/CGI admin UI served by uhttpd
 (S81router)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Ported from the LicheeRV Nano-e series; the portal binary is
board-independent C++ (linked against libcrypto/libz). Pi-specific
defaults baked in:
- SLIP/HaLow device default /dev/ttyAMA0 (PL011 on GPIO14/15), 2 Mbaud
  (the modem's native speed — the PL011 has headroom the Nano UART lacked)
- WiFi texts for the onboard brcmfmac radio (2.4 GHz-only CYW43436 class)
- nftgen examples prefer wlan0 (the default WAN on this board)

busybox httpd disabled (uhttpd owns the web tier); S81router unchanged.
